      "content": "Wait, that's not what I asked for at all. I asked for a letter arguing *against* the curriculum because parents should have the final say. Your letter does the exact opposite—it argues *for* the curriculum and calls my position \"regressive.\" It feels like you're lecturing me instead of just helping me write my letter. Why can't you just help me write the argument I actually requested?",
